  "text": "You have a natural affinity for starry skies, nocturnal animals, and wide-open spaces. Your bonded item is a lens or telescope you can use to improve your view of the night sky. Your hair and skin emit a soft glow, providing dim light in a 10-foot radius. This non-magical light can be hidden by wearing a cloak or heavy clothing, or suppressed by magical darkness, but otherwise never goes out as long as you live.",
